    <CheatEntry>
      <ID>16</ID>
      <Description>"Inf Everything (Items, Ammos, Inventory off of enemies...)"</Description>
      <VariableType>Auto Assembler Script</VariableType>
      <AssemblerScript>{ Game   : Cyberpunk 2077 (C) 2020 by CD Projekt RED
  Version: 
  Date   : 2026-05-02
  Author : bboyh

  Inf all items, including the inventory you try to
  pick up. also prevents vending machines from working.
  need to fix this by running break and trace and then
  single out the function for each item update (subtraction)
